clim extrapolation with a wide valid_range spanning 2005-2009, but only 2007 monthly
files exist on disk. refine_valid_range (called for clim via Option B) narrows the
valid_range to the actual 2007 file timestamps. The model run requests 02/29/2008
(leap day), which year-wraps to 2007 and interpolates between Feb 15 and Mar 15 2007.
No source_time is configured; the clim handler uses valid_years to anchor year-wrapping.
